Bug#34359297: Incorrect work of query with union in inner select

The problem here is with condition pushdown into a UNION.
A string literal inside a LIKE clause does not preserve the correct
character set.

The fix is in parse_expression(), preserve the character set prefix
for any literal character string that is cloned.

